+"""Five train-only epochs: ten learned block scale factors1..512 initialized at x1.
+
+Each block has FP32 theta initialized at0 and projected into[0,9] after Adam.
 Nearest integer offset, ties upward, selects source exponent+0..9; E2 modes share it.
 Backward preserves identity to G(W) and adds ln(2)*blocksum(grad_q*q) to theta.
 There is no LSQ gradient normalization and no learned E4 source scale.
 Exactly three recursive-distillation passes and one Adam step per minibatch.
-Weights and scale choices learn through epoch100, using the original LR schedule.
-Every complete epoch is saved, including epoch50 for an optional later freeze branch.
+Weights and scale choices learn through epoch5; original100-epoch LR milestones stay unchanged.
+Every complete pilot epoch is saved; no scale freezing or extended training is permitted.
 """
